      <b>Dr. Sindhuu Devarakonda is the co-founder and CPO of Blaksyd</b>, shaping Human + AI that
      revolves around you and builds meaningful conversations through <a href="/blak/">Blak</a>,
      <a href="/persona/">Persona</a>, <a href="/minit/">Minit</a>, and <a href="/nexus/">Nexus</a>.
