      and supports people across AI and human experiences.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Role at Blaksyd</h2>
    <p>
      Sindhuu leads Blaksyd as co-founder and CPO, shaping the product experience, emotional clarity,
      and user-facing feel of the Human + AI platform.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Founder FAQ</h2>
    {faqs.map((item) => (
      <details>
        <summary>{item.q}</summary>
        <p>{item.a}</p>
      </details>
    ))}
  </section>

